3</fpage><lpage>5576</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16222760</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Abramson</surname><given-names>LP</given-names></name><name><surname>Orkin</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Isolated colonic neurofibroma manifested by massive lower gastrointestinal bleeding and intussusception</article-title><source>South Med J</source><year>1997</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>952</fpage><lpage>954</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9305312</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Weisen</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Davidoff</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sideridis</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Greenberg</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Bank</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Falkowski</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neurofibroma in the colon</article-title><source>J Clin Gastroenterol</source><year>2006</year><volume>40</volume><fpage>85</fpage><lpage>86</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16340640</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carter</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Laurini</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Isolated intestinal neurofibromatous proliferations in the absence of associated systemic syndromes</article-title><source>World J Gastroenterol</source><year>2008</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>6569</fpage><lpage